# UI/UX Pro Max (Iron Lady LMS)

When building or changing UI, follow **ui-ux-pro-max** skill workflow:

1. Read `design-system/iron-lady-lms/MASTER.md`
2. Check `design-system/iron-lady-lms/pages/[page].md` for page overrides
3. Brand colors/fonts: `COMPANY_CONTEXT.md` overrides generic plugin palette

## Non-negotiable UX rules

- **Icons:** Lucide (`lucide-react`) only — no emojis as UI icons
- **Clickable:** `cursor: pointer` on buttons, links, cards with click handlers
- **Focus:** Visible `:focus-visible` ring using `var(--primary-ring)`
- **Motion:** 150–300ms transitions; respect `prefers-reduced-motion`
- **Touch:** Min 44×44px tap targets on mobile nav and primary actions
- **Loading:** Skeleton or spinner — never frozen blank UI
- **Contrast:** 4.5:1 body text; test light and dark themes
- **Layout:** No hover transforms that shift surrounding content (use shadow/opacity)
- **Safe areas:** Bottom nav clearance via `student-layout` padding

